{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 3676883, "items": [{"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2024, 9, 7]], "date-time": "2024-09-07T13:21:19Z", "timestamp": 1725715279212}, "publisher-location": "Dordrecht", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Springer Netherlands", "isbn-type": [{"type": "print", "value": "9789048148110"}, {"type": "electronic", "value": "9789401587921"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}, "DOI": "10.1007/978-94-015-8792-1_1", "type": "book-chapter", "created": {"date-parts": [[2013, 2, 7]], "date-time": "2013-02-07T15:43:25Z", "timestamp": 1360251805000}, "page": "1-70", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["Signatures of Quantum Chaos"], "prefix": "10.1007", "author": [{"given": "Norman E.", "family": "Hurt", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "297", "container-title": ["Quantum Chaos and Mesoscopic Systems"], "language": "en", "link": [{"URL": "http://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/978-94-015-8792-1_1", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2013, 2, 7]], "date-time": "2013-02-07T15:14:30Z", "timestamp": 1360250070000}, "score": 29.832867, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "http://link.springer.com/10.1007/978-94-015-8792-1_1"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}, "ISBN": ["9789048148110", "9789401587921"], "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-94-015-8792-1_1", "published": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2025, 10, 17]], "date-time": "2025-10-17T19:48:08Z", "timestamp": 1760730488444, "version": "build-2065373602"}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Oxford University PressNew York, NY", "isbn-type": [{"type": "print", "value": "9780195101676"}, {"type": "electronic", "value": "9780197732380"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[1997, 2, 13]]}, "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title>\n               <jats:p>The Bloch–Boltzmann quasiclassical theory of electronic transport in lightly disordered conductors has been quite successful in describing the impurity and temperature dependences of the conductivity in ordinary relatively pure conductors. Further transport properties such as magnetoconductivity, Hall effect, thermal conductivity, and thermopower can also be handled, often with success. However, when the amount of disorder (or impurity concentration) becomes very large, novel phenomena occur which are unexplainable within the weak-scattering theory. In particular, the temperature dependence of the resistivity, p, becomes much weaker and eventually changes direction for high enough disorder (Weismann et al. 1979). The Mathiessen rule, according to which the contributions to p due to disorder and temperature are additive, thus breaks down. An extremely interesting correlation was found by Mooij (1973), namely, that dp/dT becomes negative when p becomes larger than a value ranging around 80-180 μD cm in something like a hundred disordered dirty systems. This almost “universal” trend must have an explanation which is only weakly dependent on material properties, and we remember that dp/ dT &amp;gt; 0 always in weak-scattering theory.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.1093/oso/9780195101676.003.0002", "type": "book-chapter", "created": {"date-parts": [[2023, 11, 5]], "date-time": "2023-11-05T12:46:21Z", "timestamp": 1699188381000}, "page": "12-37", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 1, "title": ["Quantum Transport, Anderson Localization"], "prefix": "10.1093", "author": [{"given": "Yoseph", "family": "Imry", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "286", "container-title": ["Introduction to Mesoscopic Physics"], "language": "en", "link": [{"URL": "https://academic.oup.com/book/chapter-pdf/52565766/isbn-9780195101676-book-part-2.pdf", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2025, 10, 17]], "date-time": "2025-10-17T19:16:21Z", "timestamp": 1760728581000}, "score": 29.762177, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://academic.oup.com/book/54664/chapter/422639092"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[1997, 2, 13]]}, "ISBN": ["9780195101676", "9780197732380"], "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1093/oso/9780195101676.003.0002", "published": {"date-parts": [[1997, 2, 13]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2024, 9, 7]], "date-time": "2024-09-07T13:21:14Z", "timestamp": 1725715274170}, "publisher-location": "Dordrecht", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Springer Netherlands", "isbn-type": [{"type": "print", "value": "9789048148110"}, {"type": "electronic", "value": "9789401587921"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[1997]]}, "DOI": "10.1007/978-94-015-8792-1_14", "type": "book-chapter", "created": {"date-parts": [[2013, 2, 7]], "date-time": "2013-02-07T10:43:25Z", "timestamp": 1360233805000}, "page": "263-296", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 1, "title": ["Mesoscopic Structures"], "prefix": "10.1007", "author": [{"given": "Norman E.", "family": "Hurt", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "297", "container-title": ["Quantum Chaos and Mesoscopic Systems"], "language": "en", "link": [{"URL": "http://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/978-94-015-8792-1_14", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2013, 2, 7]], "date-time": "2013-02-07T10:14:27Z", "timestamp": 1360232067000}, "score": 29.741247, "res